 ## security-plan · input-validation
+decision/board-lineage-and-links-name-checked · Board lineage and links shown only when they re-parse — The board shows a recorded parent only when it re-parses as a viola name other than the row's own, a role only when it is a code word, and a link pair only when both names parse; a gone instance gives no links. · provisional
 decision/bounded-readers-census · Every product reader bounded or named — Every product reader call is bounded in its statement or named as an exception, and each external boundary's bounded read has a named witness. · guard: product_readers_are_each_bounded_or_named · except: Reads of viola's own executable for the pinned copy are not external input.
