 decision/revive-trailing-words-as-argv · revive trailing words as argv — The words after -- in viola revive go to the child as argv elements of a direct spawn.
+decision/run-lineage-flags-checked · viola run's lineage flags checked before anything is read — viola run's --parent goes through the viola name check and --role must be a code word; a --parent equal to the instance's own name is a usage error, exit 2, before anything is read. · provisional
 decision/run-resolves-absolute-program · run resolves its child program itself — viola run resolves its child program itself and hands the PTY an absolute path: a given path as given, a bare name looked up on PATH; a program not found is ProgramNotFound.
